<view class="records-page">
  <view class="page-heading">我的预约</view>
  <scroll-view scroll-x class="filter-scroller" enhanced show-scrollbar="{{false}}">
    <view class="filters">
      <view wx:for="{{tabs}}" wx:key="status" class="filter-item {{active===item.status?'is-active':''}}" data-status="{{item.status}}" bindtap="chooseTab">{{item.label}}</view>
    </view>
  </scroll-view>
  <view wx:if="{{visibleRecords.length}}" class="records-list">
    <view wx:for="{{visibleRecords}}" wx:key="id" class="record-card">
      <view class="record-head">
        <text class="record-title">{{item.serviceName}}{{item.styleName?' · '+item.styleName:''}}</text><text class="status-tag">{{item.statusLabel}}</text>
      </view>
      <view class="record-meta">日期：{{item.date}}</view>
      <view class="record-meta">时间：{{item.time}}</view>
      <view class="record-meta">定金：{{item.depositText}}</view>
    </view>
  </view>
  <view wx:else class="empty-box">
    <view class="empty-icon">▤</view>
    <view class="empty-title">暂无{{selectedText==='全部'?'':selectedText}}预约记录</view>
    <view class="empty-desc">当前尚未接入预约数据库，因此无法显示真实预约。后续这里会展示项目、款式、日期、时间、定金与审核状态。</view>
    <button class="go-button" bindtap="toBooking">去美容预约</button>
  </view>
  <view class="rule-card" bindtap="toGuide">
    <view class="rule-title">预约与定金规则 <text class="chev">›</text>
    </view>
    <view class="rule-text">顾客先提交期望时间，由管理员审核；审核通过后24小时内支付10%定金，完成付款才算预约确认。改期不重复扣定金。</view>
  </view>
</view>
